description	"Peragus Industrial Worker

Workers using improvised weaponry and mining equipment to defend themselves.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- 15% faster Movement
- Wrench (Cyan Saber)
-- No Saber/Blaster Block
-- No Saber Training
-- 200% more Kb
-- 40% less Reach
-- 167% more Radius
- Mining Laser (Pistol 2)
-- Mag Reload, Knocks Back On Hit
-- 10% Slower RoF
-- 50% more Charged FP Dmg
-- 50% more FP Drain
-- 10% less Dmg
- Pulse Grenade (1)
-- 50% Less Damage
- Fusion Cutter (Stun Baton 2)
-- Ignites on hit, 15% faster Movement, 80% faster RoF, 65% less Dmg
- Arc Caster (Lightning Thrower)
-- 20% Faster RoF, 30% More Damage
-- Ignites/Cripples/Mag Reload
-- Heavy Weight

^6Inventory:
- Personal Energy Shield ^3[CS2]

^8Attributes:
- Reinforcement (3)
- 35% Faster Hack Rate
- Blast Armor
- Get Ups (2)
- Stat Viewer
- Ammo (3)
- 5% more Kb Given
- Env Protection (1)
- Assemble (3) 

^3Abilities:
- Quickthrow (1) ^3[CS1]"
